[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m Which we already found are (b,d) = (0,0), (1,1), (4,0). Thus, the numbers are 1, 3*7=21, 3^4=81. Sum is 1+21+81=103.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m 
