[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m 3 + \frac{1}{3 + \frac{1}{\frac{10}{3}}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m Compute the denominator of the fraction: $3 + \frac{1}{\frac{10}{3}}$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m First, $\frac{1}{\frac{10}{3}} = \frac{3}{10}$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m So the denominator is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m 3 + \frac{3}{10} = \frac{30}{10} + \frac{3}{10} = \frac{33}{10}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m Now the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=390280)[0m 
